<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Locked or out of reach at the start&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The winter box (Mary's room, W): top shelf of the wardrobe; the stool from under the tubs, then the ribbon&lt;br&gt;The doll's house (children's room, W): Elliot's buttons blue, red, red, green (the carol's chorus in the piano's colours)&lt;br&gt;Zaina (children's room, E): the carol sheet for Shelly, from Mary's pocket organiser&lt;br&gt;The case (Mary's room, N): the four things; the whiteboard ticks; then the wipe&lt;br&gt;Every door is open from the start; the corridor has four views." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="800" width="360" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
